# Requirements Specification — {{project_name}}

<!-- GEN: Why: the fixed grilling process says how to ask; this skill says what to ask and how to write it in this workspace, on one screen. Kind: Mandatory — keep the purpose, adapt the structure (core/authoring-guide.md). -->
